<title>DENMARK: Norddeutsche Landesbank sets 125 mln DKK 2-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Norddeutsche Landesbank sets 125 mln DKK 2-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following new bond issue</p>
<p>was announced on Monday by borrower Norddeutsche Landesbank.</p>
<p>BORROWER - NORDDEUTSCHE LANDESBANK.</p>
<p>AMOUNT - 125 MILLION DANISH CROWNS.</p>
<p>COUPON - FOUR PERCENT.</p>
<p>MATURITY - TWO YEARS WITH RIGHT TO PROLONG UNTIL 2002.</p>
<p>PAYMENT DATES - DECEMBER 30.</p>
<p>APPLICATION HAS BEEN MADE TO LIST THE INSTRUMENTS ON THE</p>
<p>COPENHAGEN STOCK EXCHANGE ON JUNE 30 1997.</p>
<p>--Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969650</p>
</text>
